@base = http://localhost:8083

### Criar reserva (fica PENDENTE até o pagamento)
POST {{base}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": 1,
  "veiculoId": 1,
  "vagaId": 1,
  "dataInicio": "2026-12-01T14:00:00-03:00",
  "dataFim": "2026-12-01T17:00:00-03:00"
}

### Listar reservas (opcional: ?clienteId=1)
GET {{base}}/reservas

### Buscar reserva
GET {{base}}/reservas/1

### Confirmar (paga no pagamentos-service)
PUT {{base}}/reservas/1/confirmar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "metodoPagamento": "PIX" }

### Cancelar
PUT {{base}}/reservas/1/cancelar
